docs/paper/

# docs/exp: keep reports and figures only (md, png, svg, csv, dot)
docs/exp/**
!docs/exp/**/
!docs/exp/**/*.md
!docs/exp/**/*.png
!docs/exp/**/*.svg
!docs/exp/**/*.csv
!docs/exp/**/*.dot

